steam-arm-setup (2.3.1) stable; urgency=low

  * Hardware report: Steam IDs, Steam sign-in and persona names, public
    IPv4, IPv6 and e-mail addresses and token values removed; account
    named with common word no longer rewrites steam-arm-config and
    Steam paths; account name matched literally; line still holding
    account, host or sign-in name dropped.
  * Handler logs in /tmp readable by game account only.
  * Setup stops before any change without apt-get, apt-cache or dpkg,
    or with package architecture other than arm64.
  * x86 root filesystem and second graphics tree owned by root, without
    set-user-ID files; earlier trees fixed on next setup run.
  * Removal: no Kept line for file of root filesystem deleted in same
    run; empty ~/.fex-emu and runtime files of tray and launcher
    removed.
  * Tray reaps programs it started (no defunct process).

